   257                              <1> ; bu_errors -- 96E7 (checkpoint 85h), before AMI prints its error list:
   258                              <1> ; SI = 7AB2 as the replaced MOV, the message rows in the error colour
   259                              <1> ; (AMI's teletype keeps the attribute), the cursor above them (every
   260                              <1> ; message starts with CR LF). BX and BP (AMI's error flags) are kept.
