   291                              <1> ; =====================================================================
   292                              <1> ; bu_refresh -- 9791 (checkpoint 85h): AMI set the video mode again (=
   293                              <1> ; cleared the screen) before its configuration box. Redraw only if the
   294                              <1> ; screen is no longer ours: after setup, or when errors scrolled it.
   295                              <1> ; =====================================================================
   296                              <1> bu_refresh:
   297 00000131 60                  <1>     pusha
   298 00000132 1E                  <1>     push ds
